<Folder>
<name>Day 1-2 宜蘭</name>
<Placemark><name>宜蘭幾米公園</name><description>Day 1 - 繪本場景真實呈現，拍照超可愛</description><styleUrl>#d1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.758,24.752,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>羅東林業文化園區</name><description>Day 1 - 蒸汽火車頭、生態池、森林步道（免費）</description><styleUrl>#d1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.770,24.682,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>斑比山丘</name><description>Day 1 - 餵梅花鹿！像奈良一樣</description><styleUrl>#d1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.710,24.690,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>蘭城晶英酒店</name><description>Day 1-2 住宿 - 芬朵奇堡+電動車跑道</description><styleUrl>#d1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.753,24.752,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>國立傳統藝術中心</name><description>Day 2 - DIY手作（捏麵人、畫糖、藍染）、搭船遊河</description><styleUrl>#d2</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.826,24.687,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>

<Folder>
<name>Day 3-4 花蓮</name>
