<Placemark><name>東大門夜市</name><description>Day 3 - 射氣球、撈金魚、烤玉米</description><styleUrl>#d3</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.610,23.975,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>太魯閣 砂卡礑步道</name><description>Day 4 - 平緩步道，水超清澈，來回約1hr</description><styleUrl>#d4</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.492,24.171,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
