<Placemark><name>大魯閣打擊場 花蓮⚾</name><description>Day 4 - 24hr營業，各種速度</description><styleUrl>#d4</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>121.600,23.980,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>

<Folder>
